# The exact denial each document in storage-node-affinity-list.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
PersistentVolume storage-node-affinity-list must pin itself to named nodes with a bounded required nodeAffinity
